---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const contactEmail = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'hello@poteto.fun';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Poteto Daily Human Audit"
  description="Simple community rules and entertainment disclaimer for playing Poteto Daily Human Audit."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs sm:p-10">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#71717A] uppercase">
        TERMS OF SERVICE · EFFECTIVE NOV 2026
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#09090B] sm:text-3xl">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3F3F46]">
        <p>Welcome to Poteto. By playing or submitting a potato doodle, you agree to these simple ground rules:</p>

        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-base font-bold text-[#09090B]">1. Entertainment Only</h2>
        <p>
          Your &ldquo;Human Purity&rdquo; percentage and Human License Certificate are pure comedy and hold zero legal, medical, or biological weight. Even if Spud #01 ratios you on a Monday morning, you are still legally human.
        </p>

        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-base font-bold text-[#09090B]">2. Sketch Community Guidelines</h2>
        <p>
          Keep Stage 3 potato doodles family-friendly—no offensive symbols, slurs, or NSFW spam. We reserve the right to hide or remove any submission via automated filters or community flags. By submitting a doodle, you grant Poteto a non-exclusive license to display it anonymously in future daily puzzle grids.
        </p>

        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-base font-bold text-[#09090B]">3. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or moderation inquiries:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="font-mono font-semibold text-[#1A73E8] underline">
            {contactEmail}
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
